\par\par \b \uc2  Singapore dlr breaches 1.81/dlr, at 39-mth lows. \b0\par\par\uc2 266 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 April 2001\par 07:10\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE, April 2 (Reuters) - The Singapore dollar fell past the psychological 1.8100 level against the U.S. dollar for the first time since January 1998 on Monday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said it hit a low of 1.8107 against levels of around 1.8030 late on Friday due to weakness in the yen and the Thai baht , with no immediate sign of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  (MAS). \par \par \uc2  "The Sing is tracking the baht and yen very closely and with no signs of MAS in the market, the Sing has come off as expected," said a chief dealer at a European bank. \par \par \uc2  "If the baht falls to 45.30 and the yen to around 127 we can see Sing at around 1.8130 by the end of the day," he added. \par \par \uc2  The baht fell past the 45.00 support for the first time since March 1998 in early trade as the yen stumbled to fresh 30-month lows of around 126.65 after the Bank of Japan's quarterly survey showed business sentiment taking a turn for the worse. \par \par \uc2  The yen, euro and other regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  are components in the undisclosed trade-weighted basket against which the MAS manages the Singapore dollar. \par \par \uc2  The MAS said last week short-term volatility in the Sing dollar would not affect its policy stance, contrary to speculation it would shift to a neutral from a tightening bias amid a worsening external environment. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  also reiterated that it would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if necessary to dampen excessive exchange rate movements. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010713dx4202sfw\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
