\par\par \b \uc2  Emerging  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  - Off recent lows, but outlook bearish. \b0\par\par\uc2 1,450 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 Oktober 2000\par 11:42\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2      SINGAPORE, Oct 19 (Reuters) - Most Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  managed \par \par \uc2  to stay off their recent lows late on Thursday helped by lack \par \par \uc2  of fresh leads and some technical leverage but analysts said \par \par \uc2  the outlook broadly remains bearish. \par \par \uc2      Mixed equity markets offered little help and firm oil \par \par \uc2  prices, hefty losses in U.S. markets and political worries in \par \par \uc2  the  Philippines, Indonesia, Thailand and Taiwan dampened \par \par \uc2  sentiment. \par \par \uc2      The Korean won probed its eight-month low while the Taiwan \par \par \uc2  dollar lurched slightly higher from 16-month lows it hit on \par \par \uc2  Wednesday. Fears of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in both markets \par \par \uc2  kept players on guard. \par \par \uc2      Analysts said overall the region was suffering from lack of \par \par \uc2  investor confidence which deteriorated at a faster pace \par \par \uc2  recently on a worsening global environment. \par \par \uc2      "We are suffering a confidence crisis. Basically we have a \par \par \uc2  weak external environment and a weak domestic environment," \par \par \uc2  said Craig Chan, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist ING Barings in Hong Kong. \par \par \uc2      Chan said high oil prices, volatile U.S. markets and fears \par \par \uc2  of global slowdown in growth led by the U.S. had exposed \par \par \uc2  structural weaknesses in Asian corporate and financial sectors. \par \par \uc2      "We don't see anything that's really going to turn around \par \par \uc2  from now until probably after the first quarter of next year. \par \par \uc2  Domestically there's not going to be anything to impress the \par \par \uc2  markets," he said. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The euro\tab   on Thursday sank to new lows against the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par dollar and the yen in Tokyo trade, but clawed off the lows on\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par fears of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The yen\tab  , helped by euro weakness, managed to keep\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the dollar below the 108 level.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     World oil prices held firm on concerns about low U.S.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par inventories ahead of the winter.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     KOREAN WON\tab    -2\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The won rebounded to close unchanged at around its\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par five-month low after hitting an eight-month trough earlier in\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the day.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Dealers said fears of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  prompted\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par players to square their long dollar positions as the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par reached the 1,142.9 level in the afternoon, its lowest since\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par February 25.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Analysts said foreign funds' selling in the equity market,\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par already off by about 50 percent from the 1999 close, weighed on\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par sentiment.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "Korea is suffering from lack of confidence because\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par basically we ourselves underestimated the time in which\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par confidence would be restored in Korea in terms of\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par restructuring, and that obviously has hit the equity market,"\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par ING Barings' Chan said said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Chan said high oil prices and an expected slowdown in\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par growth of electronic exports was likely to hit Korea's\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par strongest positive - trade surplus.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     He said the other hit to the surplus was likely to come\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par from the foreign investment front.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     "There is still excess supply of dollars, it's true from\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the balance of payments perspective. But the point is,\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par portfolio outflows have recently accelerated at such a pace\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par that obviously it must hit FDI (foreign direct investment) and\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the current account surplus," he said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par THAI BAHT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The baht regained some lost ground as selling pressure\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par eased after a sizeable dollar/baht option expired on Thursday,\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par dealers in Bangkok and Singapore said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Dealers said one foreign entity had hedged against its\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par investment in Thailand by buying an option offering a strike\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par price of 44 baht per dollar.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "The baht had been under selling pressure in the past few\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par days partly because of this option. Now, that it expired\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par without reaching that level, the pressure was off," said a\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par dealer at a major European bank.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "Some dollar/baht option deals barely affect the market,\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par but I heard this one was around $200 million...sizeable enough\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par to move the market," he said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The baht was also lifted by \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  supportive\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par remarks, saying the unit would not fall to 44 per dollar and\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par that it had seen no speculation.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     But the bank again defended its low interest rate policy\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par which it regarded as crucial in sustaining economic recovery.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     SINGAPORE DOLLAR\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The Sing dollar stayed clear of its overnight low of\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1.7580, as fears of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Monetary Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Singapore\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  (MAS) kept trading tame.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     However dealers said the Sing dollar would likely fall in\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the next few sessions as the U.S. dollar continued to tower\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par over regional \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     They also said the MAS could wait for the rate to shoot up\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par to 1.76 before \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervening\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the market, but that no one was\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par willing to start testing the authority.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par      "There's no reason for the Sing dollar to move higher. The\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par non-oil exports data was dismal, and all the regionals are\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par down," said a dealer at a European bank.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Singapore's non-oil domestic exports in September recorded\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par growth of nearly 12 percent, but below analysts' average\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par expectation of an 18 percent rise.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     A clean break by the U.S. dollar of 108 against the yen or\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par further falls in the euro could be a trigger for the Sing\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par dollar to move lower, he added.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par      TAIWAN DOLLAR\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The Taiwan dollar was hovering above its 16-month closing\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par low as jitters in the island's stock markets spilled over to\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     After easing its defence of the Taiwan dollar in the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par previous session, Taiwan's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  was back in action on\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Thursday. Dealers said it \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  at the opening, pushing\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  down to 31.50. The move caught many players by\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par surprise, said a dealer at a U.S. bank.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Dealers estimate the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  spent around $200 million\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par in its \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on Thursday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Meanwhile, the third quarter earnings of Taiwan\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Semiconductor Manufacturing Co. , the world's\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par largest dedicated microchip foundry, beat expectations.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The company also said its outlook for 2001 remained\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par positive, which may help calm the nerves of local retail\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par investors who have been fleeing Taiwan's equity markets.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Heavy stock losses, triggered by gloomy predictions of a\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par slowdown in the tech sector and eroding confidence in the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par government, have been weighing on the Taiwan dollar.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     INDONESIA RUPIAH\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The rupiah continued to ignore the downtrend in regional\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , and clung to its recent range of 8,800 to 9,000.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is expected to remain in that range for the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par next several sessions. Local companies seeking dollars\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par dominated trading, as they have for the past few weeks.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Dealers said they didn't expect any real movement in the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par rupiah until the end of the month, when many local companies\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par had to repay foreign debts.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     News that the Consultative Group on Indonesia had agreed to\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par lend $5.3 billion to Jakarta failed to move the rupiah. The aid\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par package was widely expected, and thus already factored into the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par market, dealers said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par PHILIPPINE PESO\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The peso retained its bearish tone, hovering around its\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par record low of 49.00, after the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  said previously it\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par had not decided on further measures to prop up the ailing\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  governor Rafael Buenaventura said on Thursday\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par he hoped the pressure on the peso would ease in the next 30-90\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par days, referring to the forthcoming election in Thailand which\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par has had unsettling effect on the baht.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Analysts said further downside risks remained intact due to\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par lack of investor confidence even though the Philippine economy\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par has performed relatively well this year.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "What is clear is that the peso's weakness is likely to be\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par fought aggressively due to the debt servicing and sentiment\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par implications of a weaker peso," said Steve Brice, treasury\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par economist at Standard Chartered in Singapore.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "In the short-term, the authorities are likely to use\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par measures that have already been employed - higher interest\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par rates, tighter reserves requirements and \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par - but more aggressively," he said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Brice added if those measures failed to stop the peso from\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par weakening, the market should not rule out more drastic measures\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par such as capital controls or debt moratorium.\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 CURRENCIES\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  VS U.S. DOLLAR  0840 GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Change on the day\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2     Latest bid     Prev Close    Pct Move\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Japan yen     107.79\tab  108.01\tab    +0.20\par  Sing dlr\tab 1.7538\tab  1.7559\tab    +0.12\par  Taiwan dlr    32.325\tab  32.383\tab    +0.18\par  Korean won   1137.00\tab 1137.00\tab    +0.00\par  Baht\tab      43.50\tab   43.52\tab    +0.05\par  Peso\tab      48.77\tab   48.45\tab    -0.66\par  Rupiah\tab  8887.00\tab 8890.00\tab    +0.03\par  Ringgit\tab  3.7995\tab  3.7997\tab    +0.01\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Change on year\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \tab Latest     End prev yr     Pct Move\par  Japan yen     107.79\tab  102.21\tab    -5.18\par  Sing dlr\tab 1.7538\tab  1.6640\tab    -5.12\par  Taiwan dlr    32.325\tab  31.380\tab    -2.92\par  Korean won   1137.00\tab 1135.00\tab    -0.18\par  Baht\tab      43.50\tab   37.45\tab   -13.91\par  Peso\tab      48.77\tab   40.20\tab   -17.57\par  Rupiah\tab  8887.00\tab 6975.00\tab   -21.51\par  Ringgit\tab  3.7995\tab  3.8000\tab    +0.01.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010822dwaj03vwx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
