\par\par \b \uc2  Emerging  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  - Edgy as stocks fall, oil price rises. \b0\par\par\uc2 1,225 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 Oktober 2000\par 04:17\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2      SINGAPORE, Oct 11 (Reuters) - Most Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  drooped \par \par \uc2  in early trade on Wednesday as domestic worries and external \par \par \uc2  factors combined to work against them. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Sharp losses in the Nasdaq\tab    are expected to hurt\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par regional stocks further and keep outflow momentum going.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     A fresh uptick in oil prices caused by heightened tensions\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par in the Middle East and an early U.S. cold snap also reignited\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par concerns over its impact on Asia's trade surpluses.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Analysts maintained recommendations that investors stay\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par away from emerging Asian assets -- a call which could add\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par further downward pressure to the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     "The region's dramatic sell-off of late is consistent with\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par our focus on the prospects for a global slowdown, impacting on\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par cyclical tech stocks and our finding that Asia's macro momentum\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par is weaker than elsewhere," a Merrill Lynch report said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "Growth rates are slowing across Asia, trade surpluses are\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par narrowing and high oil prices are fuelling inflationary uptick\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par that central banks are doing their best to ignore," it said,\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par adding it stayed underweight the region.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The yen\tab   was around the 108 level amid good two-way\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par flows.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Japanese investment flow data showed a portfolio inflow to\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the country stood at about 1.1 trillion in September, which\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par should be supportive of the yen.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The euro stood around $0.87, supported by wariness over\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par possible further \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 SINGAPORE\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  DOLLAR\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The Sing dollar was down in line with other regional\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and on demand for the U.S. dollar by local\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par corporates seeking overseas investments.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     But analysts said a sudden spurt of U.S. dollar selling\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par late Tuesday, that sparked talk of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , was likely to\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par keep the Sing in a tight range.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     UBS Warburg in a research note said it believes the\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Monetary Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of Singapore (MAS) was not in the market but\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par added the fears of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  were "well founded".\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     "With the SGD on a trade weighted basis back on levels\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par where the MAS had signalled on July 27 that they wanted to see\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par a modest appreciation of the SGD from, we continue to be wary\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par about buying the USD here," the note said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Technical analysts say a break of 1.7527 level, tested\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par twice in the past several days, would push the dollar/sing to\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the next psychological level of 1.7600.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par THAI BAHT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The baht sank to 27-month lows on regionals and higher oil\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par prices, with some light dollar profit taking at around 43.00\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par helping arrest the fall. Dealers said in the absence of good\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par news, the baht could dip further.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Players put the prospective sales of Bangkok Metropolitan\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Bank to HSBC Holdings Plc on a slow burner for now and\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par focused in stead on the negatives.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "With the sale still having to be approved by both the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par purchasers's board and the Thai cabinet, and with up to $400\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par million of the estimated $900 million sale likely to be\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par financed by promissory notes, the market has given up on the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par sale being able to influence the baht for the time being," said\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par UBS Warburg.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "The baht sentiment continues to be nervous with the market\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par focusing on fundamental outflows, the elections and regional\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  weakness," it said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par PHILIPPINE PESO\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The Philippine peso continued its downturn in early\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par trading, hitting a record low of 47.00 this morning.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Dealers said the scandal over allegations of gambling\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par payoffs made to President Joseph Estrada were still plaguing\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par While an impeachment of Estrada is highly unlikely, Rebecca\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Patterson, a \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  strategist at J.P. Morgan, pointed out\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the persistent political instability in the Philippines was\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par driving investors away from the country.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     "It's not the impeachment risk as such, but political risk\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par keeps coming up," she said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The heightened political risk in the Philippines has hit\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par foreign direct investment inflows. According to Patterson, for\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the year to September, the Philippines had net inflows of $584\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par million in announced foreign investment, compared with\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Thailand's $1.68 billion in the same period.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     This factor, along with the country's widening budget\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par deficit, have been weighing heavily on the peso.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Dealers also said the market has been ignoring the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central\par \f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 \par bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's attempts to shore up the peso, including its \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par risk protection programme.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     However, the dollar's rise may be capped this session\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par around 47.10, as there are stops around that level.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     KOREAN WON\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The won followed the Korean share market lower in early\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par trading, as the benchmark Korea Composite Share Price Index\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par fell over three percent this morning on the back of the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Nasdaq's 3.4 percent fall.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Dealers said foreign investors have been net sellers in the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Korean stock market, and the equity-related flows have been the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par main influence on the won.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par In addition to the Nasdaq's fall, the 10.1% drop in the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Philadelphia Semiconductor Index has also hurt Korea's major\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par chip stocks, including Samsung Electronics, which makes up the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par bulk of many foreign portfolios.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Dealers added that the market was keeping an eye on GM\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  and Fiat SpA's talks with Daewoo Motor to buy\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the debt-ridden Korean automaker's assets and related units.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par TAIWAN DOLLAR\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The Taiwan dollar was clouded by falling stock prices in\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par early trade as the TAIEX skidded through a key\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par psychological support of 6,000 again.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par But the yen's resilience and fears of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  should help limit the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's downside, dealers\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par in \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Singapore\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The market resumed trading after closing on Tuesday for the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par National Day holiday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     INDONESIAN RUPIAH\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The rupiah edged lower in thin trading and dealers said it\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par was likely to remain rangebound on a lack of market-moving\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par news.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     "The flow of news has been quite down in the past few days,\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par so the market is slow and I think we are not going to see any\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par major move," a \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  analyst said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The analysts said thin volume in the market suggested major\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par players were waiting for next week's donor meeting of the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Consultative Group on Indonesia in Tokyo.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Indonesia will be seeking around $4.8 billion in fresh aid\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par to help ease the burden of foreign debt repayment, bridge a\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par gaping budget deficit and restructure its troubled corporate\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par and financial sectors.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Dealers said the rupiah may also get some support from news\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Japan's Finance Minister Kiichi Miyazawa had pledged support to\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Indonesia at the meeting of the Consultative Group.\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 CURRENCIES\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  VS U.S. DOLLAR  0215 GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Change on the day\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2     Latest bid     Prev Close    Pct Move\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Japan yen     107.90\tab  107.95\tab    +0.05\par  Sing dlr\tab 1.7517\tab  1.7500\tab    -0.10\par  Taiwan dlr 