\par\par \b \uc2  Asian  \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention \highlight\uc2  threat remains alive. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Anchalee Koetsawang \par \uc2 720 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 September 2000\par 06:45\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 SINGAPORE\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Sept 26 (Reuters) - Concerted \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by leading industrialised nations to boost the ailing euro last week is giving Asian central banks a break, but analysts said it might be a matter of time before they feel the need to act on their \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  There have been signs recently, explicit or subtle, that some regional central banks might be wringing their hands over high oil prices and sliding \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  across the region, which trended downward for several weeks on concerns over the impact of oil prices and the euro, rebounded slightly following Friday's surprise \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Group of Seven (G7) industrialised nations. \par \par \uc2  But analysts dismissed the market reaction as knee-jerk. With sentiment for the dollar remaining strong and more people betting against Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  due to political and economic uncertainty, they could soon head towards levels that would prompt the authorities to react. \par \par \uc2  "They might not need to be in the market at this point. But I would not rule out the possibility," said Chia Woon-Khien, chief analyst at SEB Merchant Banking in Singapore. \par \par \uc2  "Normally, there are three conditions that prompt central banks to act - when \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  drop below certain target levels, when the pace is out of synch with others in the region, and when domestic factors lead to speculative actions. These risks are still very prominent," she said. \par \par \uc2  TAIWAN AND THE PHILIPPINES \par \par \uc2  Taiwan's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , frequently in the market for smoothing \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 , has been particularly vigilant in the past few weeks to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  which is hurt by outflows and poor sentiment brought about by uncertainty over the tech sector. \par \par \uc2  Last Monday alone, dealers estimated its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  accounted for a third of the day's $689 million turnover. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers in the Philippines said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  might have spent around $250 million to $300 million during the first half of this month to defend the peso. \par \par \uc2  The bank says it has not been in the market since last week, but adds it does not rule out the possibility in the future. \par \par \uc2  BAHT'S MIXED SIGNALS \par \par \uc2  In Thailand, government officials have sent mixed signals to the market recently on \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  While one minister said the authorities might resort to short-term market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  if excessive volatility in the baht hurt the economy, another senior minister said there was no need to prop it up. \par \par \uc2  Contradicting remarks notwithstanding, there have been signs the authorities are growing concerned about the macro picture. \par \par \uc2  Some economists forecast that if the baht fell below 43 per dollar, the government's inflation target of 2.5-3.0 percent for this year could be breached. \par \par \uc2  "Last week, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was in the market to check for rates and monitor who's involved in major transactions. I think they were quite edgy," said a European bank dealer in Bangkok. \par \par \uc2  "I don't pay attention to what officials say. Before the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in May when the baht was around 39, they had said the same thing. With political uncertainty intensifying, the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  risk is very much there," he said. \par \par \uc2  Thailand is expected to hold an election later this year. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Thailand has adopted a hands-off policy on the baht since floating it in July 1997. But it has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market occasionally to smooth out volatility. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 SINGAPORE\b0 \highlight\uc2 'S IMPORTED INFLATION \par \par \uc2  Worries about potential \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  kept the Sing dollar above the key psychological 1.7500 level after briefly dipping below that mark on Friday for the first time since July 24. \par \par \uc2  Singapore manages its dollar against a trade-weighted basket of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , using the exchange rate as a tool to fight inflation in its open economy. \par \par \uc2  With inflation as measured by price of imported manufactured goods surging to nearly 10 percent, some analysts reckon the government might soon act to curb inflation before it reaches consumer prices. \par \par \uc2  "These are rates which have triggered policy actions on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the past," said David Carbon, strategist at Pacific Asset Management. \par \par \uc2  "Authorities in recent weeks have begun reminding the public and financial markets that pre-crisis \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  policies remain the order of the day, and fighting inflation with \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  appreciation will be pursued as and when the need arises," Carbon said in a recent report. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010821dw9q06kgr\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
